      "markdown": "- Plan\n- Approve\n- Create solicitation\n- Solicit\n- Receive and evaluate\n- Negotiate\n- Award\n- Manage",
      "plain_text": "Plan ; Approve ; Create solicitation ; Solicit ; Receive and evaluate ; Negotiate ; Award ; Manage"
