        "Initiating new standards, specifications or listings"
      ],
      "markdown": "When a need for a new standard, specification or listing is identified, and nothing suitable is under development, you should suggest that that the client contact CGSB . If the need is specific to a single client, sector or region, they may establish a qualification program specific to them. The client, sector or region should establish procedures that promote open competition and equal opportunity for all businesses. If criteria other than technical performance are applied, the distribution of listings should be restricted. Any distributed listings should clearly state the qualification criteria.",
